# Static export of the Command Center — a build artifact of `make replay-build`.
frontend/out/

# NOTE: `frontend/public/replay/` IS committed, deliberately.
#
# These bundles are generated from the committed proof packs by `make replay`.
# They were previously gitignored to avoid a second copy of evidence drifting
# from the packs it claims to render — a real risk, and the reason the CI
# `backend` job now regenerates them and fails on any diff.
#
# They are committed because the published replay URL must build on a static
# host with no Python toolchain. Generating them at deploy time made a
# judge-facing demonstration depend on a Python runtime being present in a
# Node build image, which is not guaranteed. The drift guard replaces that
# risk with a check that runs on every push.

# OTLP verification artifact, regenerated by scripts/verify_otel.py.
docs/verification/
